{"id":"memorial_104004","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial104000","label":"Memoirs · Diary of Despair"},"label":"Revenge","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_104003","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_104004_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_40_04_description","text":"We decided to get revenge."},{"id":"memorial_104004_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_40_04_description","text":"All four of us gathered and agreed to give the Offsprings what for."},{"id":"memorial_104004_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_40_04_description","text":"None of us had to say anything. I could see the fire in their eyes."},{"id":"memorial_104004_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_40_04_description","text":"We'll get back at those scoundrels."},{"id":"memorial_104004_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_40_04_description","text":"We'll take away all that they hold dear."},{"id":"memorial_104004_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_40_04_description","text":"I feel like I can finally sleep."},{"id":"memorial_104004_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_40_04_description","text":"Having a goal is a wondrous thing."}]}